# Project Context — AML Automation

## What the project does

AI-DLC pipeline that reads Excel (.xlsx) or .docx test case documents and generates Playwright tests. Targets the AML application at `https://kadelamldev.customerxps.com:2506` — login required (`EMAIL` / `PASSWORD` in `.env`).

## Tech stack

| Item | Version |
|------|---------|
| Playwright | ^1.60.0 |
| mammoth | ^1.8.0 |
| tsx | ^4.19.0 |
| dotenv | ^17.2.3 |
| allure-js-commons | ^3.x |
| allure-commandline | ^2.x |

---

## High-level architecture

```
Excel / FSD+Figma → Cursor agents (.cursor) → tests/milestone2/
                              ↓
         Playwright → results/ (raw) → report/ (published Allure/Excel)
```

**New generated tests** go under `tests/milestone2/` (same layout as milestone1). Do **not** use `tests/e2e/` for new cases.

